# Axon OS NVIDIA edition (GTX 16-series, RTX and newer): the NVIDIA driver, signed for
# Secure Boot, plus the 32-bit libraries Steam needs. One package per line; blank lines
# and "#" comments are ignored. These must install: a name that does not exist fails the build.

# Metapackage in packaging/axon-nvidia (driver branch pinned there)
axon-nvidia
